# Vercel build-source allowlist. Only _prod becomes public static output.
# api/ and lib/ remain source inputs for Vercel Functions; scripts/.sync/docs are build-only inputs.
/*
!.vercelignore
!api/
!api/**
!lib/
!lib/**
!assets/
!assets/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!.sync/
!.sync/r8-modules/
!.sync/r8-modules/**
!.well-known/
!.well-known/**
!vercel.json
!package.json
!MINIMAX_ENV.example
!TECHNICAL_DATA_SOURCES.md
!TECHNICAL_DOCUMENT_GOVERNANCE.md
!VISUAL_MANIFEST_R15_7.json
!manifest.webmanifest
!robots.txt
!sitemap.xml
!llms.txt
!*.html
